<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Daewoo yr share dips, no div.</title>
<headline>Daewoo yr share dips, no div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     6.4	   vs   6.7</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 nil	   vs   2.5</p>
<p>    Net earnings	    3.29	  vs   2.69</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   3.16	  vs   4.56</p>
<p>    Tax			 0.13	  vs   1.88</p>
<p>    Interest paid	  19.36	  vs   5.24</p>
<p>    Turnover		332.64	  vs 170.55</p>
<p>Full name: Daewoo Electronics SA Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said that as a result of the increased level of borrowing and the lower interest cover, it had decided not to declare a dividend.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
